  "body": "Beautifully renovated and bathed in natural light, this north-facing St Heliers home combines character, warmth and effortless everyday living. \r\n\r\nThoughtfully updated throughout, the home features a lovely, practical kitchen, a renovated bathroom, beautifully polished timber floors and light-filled open-plan living that flows out to a new sun-soaked deck.\r\n\r\nWith three generous bedrooms, excellent indoor-outdoor connection and the convenience of a single garage plus additional off-street parking, this is an inviting, easy-care home where the hard work has already been done.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n• 3 bedrooms\r\n• Beautiful north-facing aspect\r\n• Lovely, practical kitchen\r\n• Renovated bathroom\r\n• Polished timber floors\r\n• New sun-soaked deck\r\n• Light-filled open-plan living\r\n• Single carport\r\n• 1 additional off-street car park\r\n• In zone for Glendowie College\r\n• Sought-after St Heliers location\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
